<h1>Living on a pension: what the money can cover</h1>

<p class="lede">Whether a pension is enough depends on what is being asked. What people spend, what research says a standard of living costs, and what one household needs are three different things. This page keeps them apart, then gives you a budget to fill in yourself.</p>

{{ m.contents([
